      Build an object literal mapping attribute names to values:

const attrs = {
  role: "alert",
  "aria-live": "polite",
  "data-visible": "true",
};

      If the string is used across files, move it to .constants.ts:

export const STRINGS = Object.freeze({
  dataGuardMsg: "data-guard-msg",
  dataClientLocalized: "data-client-localized",
} as const);

